    d("10:3:13", "In the inherited kuşatmak rendering of istawa, Arş'ı is an accusative object; ala has no separately pronounced on surface in that chosen frame. Retain the local valency display only. This does not endorse kuşattı as the uniquely correct meaning of istawa: that broader lexical/theological question remains a follow-up.", True)
    d("10:3:21 10:3:22 10:3:23", "Retain the explicitly inspected after-permission relation O'nun izninden sonra; min, bad and the permission noun each retain their case, time and content contribution.", True)
