    d("11:69:12", "Fa-ma labitha an jaa is idiomatically he did not delay in bringing, hence hemen getirdi. Turkish realizes the content as a finite clause without a separate an ending; retain this idiom rather than duplicate an infinitive or reverse the immediacy.", True)
    p("11:80", "wished-possession", [("benim",4),(" olsaydı",3)], "Law anna li expresses wished-for possession: keşke benim ... olsaydı. Expose the optative content at anna, leaving the possessive pronoun at li; law already provides keşke.")
