    d("12:7:3", "The locative fi has shared scope across Yusuf and his brothers, with Turkish -nde pronounced on the final coordinated kardeşlerinde. Retain that coordination rather than invent a second obligatory locative.", True)
    p("12:20", "unwilling-membership", [("isteksizler",9),("den",8)], "Min al-zahidin expresses membership in those uninterested in him. Turkish isteksizlerden exposes that membership, rather than omitting min entirely.")
