    d("12:21:10 17:8:3 17:51:23 17:79:8 18:40:3", "Individually retain an under asa/belki/umulur ki: Turkish uses a finite hoped-for or possible predicate. Its complement relation is real but has no separate nominal suffix in the chosen frame; do not impose a mismatched nominal ending or a second modal.", True)
